---
// About section — bio + quick stats (contact details moved to Contact section)
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-accent-600 uppercase tracking-widest">About Me</span>
      <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">
        Brisbane IT professional with 10+ years of experience
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-lg">
        <p>
          I'm a CRM Developer and IT professional based in Brisbane, QLD. Currently at
          RSL Queensland, I design and build solutions across Microsoft Dynamics 365,
          Power Platform, and Azure DevOps — helping one of Australia's largest veterans'
          organisations connect more effectively with its members.
        </p>
        <p>
          My background spans the full IT spectrum: from hands-on desktop support and
          infrastructure through to application development and release management. I enjoy
          solving real problems for real people, and I bring a practical, get-it-done
          mindset to every project.
        </p>
        <p>
          Outside of work I'm expanding my skills in cloud technologies and modern web
          development — including building this site.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick stats -->
      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        {[
          { value: '10+', label: 'Years in IT' },
          { value: '4',   label: 'Employers' },
          { value: 'BIT', label: 'Degree from QUT' },
          { value: 'BCS', label: 'Foundation Cert in BA' },
        ].map((stat) => (
          <div class="text-center px-6 py-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-accent-600">{stat.value}</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 font-medium">{stat.label}</div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
